    - target: {fileID: 722356562095301255, guid: cac1b875eb4cf4f4f853213b28b77804, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Every day, scammers target people through messages, emails, and job
        offers. \nIn this realistic simulation, you\u2019ll explore a phone interface
        just like your own, filled with genuine and fake communications. \nYou\u2019ll
        learn to recognize red flags, question suspicious messages, and make confident
        choices to stay safe. \nPractice spotting scams in a risk-free environment,
        and build practical skills to protect yourself and others from fraud in the
        real world."
